'''Rossari Biotech''' is an Indian [[chemical manufacturing]] company with a focus on [[specialty chemicals]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Rossari Biotech share price up by 2.31% – Why is Rossari Biotech share price up today? |url=https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/rossari-biotech-ltd/stocks/companyid-49994.cms |website=economictimes.indiatimes.com}}</ref> It is also engaged in production of specialty enzymes and chemicals in India that is used in the [[pharmaceuticals]], [[paper]], [[construction]], [[textiles]], [[nutrition]] and [[animal health]] industries.<ref name="a">{{cite news |last1=Mudgill |first1=Amit |title=Rossari Biotech IPO: Things you must know about specialty chemical company |url=https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/ipos/fpos/rossari-biotech-ipo-things-you-must-know-about-specialty-chemical-company/articleshow/76907314.cms |accessdate=6 September 2020 |work=The Economic Times}}</ref> The company was started in 2003 as a partnership firm titled ''Rossari Labtech'' and was incorporated into a company in 2009 and was renamed as Rossari Biotech.<ref>{{cite web |title=History {{!}} Rossari Biotech Limited |url=https://www.rossari.com/about/history/ |website=www.rossari.com/about/history |date=11 July 2019 |accessdate=6 September 2020}}</ref>

It has two [[R&D]] facilities, one at [[Silvassa]] manufacturing facility and the second in [[Dahej]].<ref name="a"/>

